OL,3,GNEWSA#1m towards fighting city child
OL,4,Apoverty 'crisis'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLater this month, the council's cabinet
OL,7,Fwill commit #1.19m to Citizens Advice
OL,8,FLiverpool to support its anti-child
OL,9,Fpoverty work.
